1. Check file with information debug 
- $ file ledRgbDemo

2. Start debug 
- gdb ./ledRgbDemo
or with a program has input argument
- gdb --args ./ledRgbDemo 15

3. Step, breakpoint, next
- step: go to next line ( into a function )
- next: go over to a function 
- b main
- b ledInit
- b driver/ledDriver.c:24
- i b

4. break point with condition
- break ledSetPixelColor if index == 0

5. display information after each commdn in gdb 
- display index
- display/x ledBuffer[index]

6. Show info CPU register
- info registers

7. show by command print
- print/<format> <expression>
- print/d index
- print/x ledBuffer[index]  /*Hexadecimal*/

8. show GUI
- layout src
- layout regs
- layout asm
- layout split

9. Check value in address
- x/<count><format><size> <address>
- x/10wx ledBuffer  /* see 10 element buffer */
- x/4bx &ledBuffer[index] /* see each byte  */

10. watchpoint
- watch ledCount
- continue

11. loging
- set logging file gdb.log
- set logging overwrite on
- set logging on  /* Start save log to file gdb.log */
- set logging off /* turn off log */

12. attach process
- gdb ./ledRgbDemo <PID>

13. stack frame
- bt
- f <number>
- i f
- info locals

14. Core dunmp
- Kiểm tra xem OS có cho phep gen ra coredump 
    + ulimit -c
        --> 0 là ko tạo ra 
    + cấu hình tạo ra coredump
        --> ulimit -c unlimited
    + Ghi core ra 1 thư mục cụ thể
        --> sudo sysctl -w kernel.core_pattern=/tmp/core.%e.%p
    + gdb ./ledRgbDemo /tmp/core.ledRgbDemo.****

